[36m==>[0m [1mTwo ways to install[0m
  [1msystem[0m (sudo)  A dedicated [1mxbin[0m system user owns the service and workspace
                 under /opt/xbin — better separation from your account, and the
                 usual choice for a shared or long-lived box. Needs root.
  [1muser[0m   (no root, ever)  Everything lives under YOUR account in ~/.local and
